src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":6,"text":"The Bouriat-Etancelin duel goes on.","q":false,"c":6},{"lap":11,"text":"On lap 11 Etancelin finally managed to pass Bouriat for the lead.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":16,"text":"When they came up to lap the Swiss driver Villars in an Alfa Romeo Monza, Villars gave way and Etancelin passed without problem.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":16,"text":"Bouriat's Bugatti slides off and hits a tree at about 150 km/h; it bursts into flames and Bouriat is killed.","q":false,"c":6},{"lap":17,"text":"The race went on with Etancelin, not realizing of what had happened, carrying on at full speed. Several minutes behind him were Sommer and Lehoux fighting for second position.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":18,"text":"Soon afterwards Robert Brunet crashed his Bugatti T51 but escaped with a broken ankle.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":9},{"lap":20,"text":"Etancelin took the flag almost three minutes ahead of Sommer who barely won the duel for second place. Lehoux was third","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0}]}